// After
type discriminatorGroup struct {
	name       string
	discMember *types.Member
	// members maps field names to their rules in this discriminator group.
	members map[string]*fieldMemberRules
}
```

The field `discriminatorMember` is renamed to `discMember` within the `discriminatorGroup` struct.

Which files within the `kubernetes/kubernetes` repository would fail to compile or exhibit a runtime regression as a result of this change? List each file by its path relative to the repository root.
